cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or the sufficient-statistics artefact, please cite the accompanying paper."
title: "CAN IDS evaluation toolkit and sufficient-statistics artefact for “Cross-Session Generalisation of CAN and CAN FD Intrusion Detection”"
abstract: >-
  Code, configuration, frozen tables and sufficient statistics for a measurement study on
  windowed CAN / CAN FD intrusion detection: threshold provenance, in-window attack-density
  stratification, capture-level and recording-group sign-flip inference, and a CPU-only
  single-board-computer deployment measurement. No corpus-derived tensors are distributed.
